OL,3,GNEWSABadger rescuer criticised by
OL,4,Awildlife welfare charities
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree wildlife welfare charities have
OL,7,Fcriticised a Scottish ecologist who is
OL,8,Fhoping to keep a badger he has nursed
OL,9,Fback to health.
OL,11,FGraeme Wilson was called out to help
OL,12,Fthe badger, named Harriet, after she
OL,13,Fwas found in a cattle trough 300ft
OL,14,F(100m) from her sett.
OL,16,FHe believes she was hand-reared prior
OL,17,Fto this and would not survive in the
OL,18,Fwild. He applied to NatureScot to keep
OL,19,Fthe animal but they turned him down.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
