OL,3,GNEWSABadger rescuer criticised by
OL,4,Awildlife welfare charities
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a strongly-worded statement, the
OL,7,FBritish Wildlife Rehabilitation
OL,8,FCouncil, Scottish Badgers and the
OL,9,FBadgers Trust said the case raised
OL,10,Fserious animal welfare concerns.
